  "description": "Answer key for the findings-only Python sample. Each job reaches one short function with one security decision or sink, and reportkit_service ships the consumer that turns the decision into an effect: a browser-facing router (driven from a job file through the request operation, or served by reportkit_serve.py), a session store, a role check on payroll, a refund ledger, and an export link route. The classes array records every class the example establishes; primitive remains the primary scoring label.",
